      "title": {
        "en": "Jaki bilet?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A ticket, *bilet*, is *normalny* (full price, *za sto procent ceny*) or *ulgowy*, *ze zniżką* (with a discount), for example *dla studentów* or *dla emerytów*. It is *w jedną stronę* (one way) or *tam i z powrotem* (there and back). On a fast train you also need *miejscówka*, a seat reservation."
      },
